 C, 02 C, 8A C, 14 C,  83 C, C6 C, 02 C,          8A C, 3C C, 83 C, C6 C, 02 C, 8B C, 04 C, 89 C, 06 C,           HTERM ,  83 C, C6 C, 02 C, 56 C, 51 C, 83 C, E9 C, 03 C,        F7 C, D9 C, D1 C, E1 C, 03 C, 0E C, VOUT ,  8B C, F9 C,         8B C, 36 C, VIN' ,  06 C, 8B C, 0E C, 3DSEG , 8E C, C1 C,       8B C, 0E C, #IN ,  8B C, 2E C, HTERM , 26 C, 8A C, 04 C,        46 C, F6 C, EE C, 03 C, E8 C,  26 C, 8A C, 04 C, 46 C,          F6 C, EA C, 03 C, E8 C, 26 C, 8A C, 04 C, 46 C, F6 C, EF C,     03 C, E8 C, 26 C, 89 C, 2D C, 83 C, C7 C, 06 C, E2 C, DC C,     07 C, 59 C, 5E C, E2 C, A1 C, 5E C, 5D C, 5F C, AD C, 8B C,     D8 C, FF C, 27 C,                                             DECIMAL                                                                                                                         ( ORBIT-OV - PERSPEC.SCREEN                           12-21-84) CREATE PERSPEC.SCREEN HERE DUP 2- ! HEX                           57 C, 55 C, 56 C, 06 C, 8B C, 3E C, VOUT , 83 C, C7 C, 04 C,    8B C, 36 C, YSCREEN , 8B C, 0E C, 3DSEG , 8E C, C1 C,           8B C, 2E C, YMAG ,  8B C, 0E C, #IN ,  26 C, 8B C, 1D C,        83 C, EF C, 02 C, 26 C, 8B C, 05 C, F7 C, ED C, F7 C, FB C,     03 C, C6 C, 26 C, 89 C, 05 C, 83 C, EF C, 02 C, 26 C, 8B C,     05 C, F7 C, 2E C, XMAG ,  F7 C, FB C, 03 C, 06 C, XSCREEN ,     26 C, 89 C, 05 C, 83 C, C7 C, 0A C, E2 C, D6 C, 07 C, 5E C,     5D C, 5F C, AD C, 8B C, D8 C, FF C, 27 C,                     DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( ORBIT-OV - ASIN/COS ASIN-CALC                       12-21-84) CREATE ASIN/COS 8 C, 25 C, 41 C, 56 C, 71 C, 84 C,                95 C, 106 C, 114 C, 120 C, 125 C, 127 C,                      HEAD: ASIN-CALC                                                 T: ( n -- s*127, find sin given survey column #[0-47])            DUP 12 <                                                        IF 1 SWAP                     ( quadrant I)                     ELSE DUP 24 <                                                     IF 1 SWAP 23 - NEGATE       ( quadrant II)                      ELSE DUP 36 <                                                      IF -1 SWAP 24 -          ( quadrant III)                        ELSE -1 SWAP 47 - NEGATE ( quadrant IV)                         THEN                                                         THEN                                                          THEN                                                            ASIN/COS + C@ SWAP -1 = IF NEGATE THEN T;                     ( ORBIT-OV - ACOS-CALC                                12-21-84) HEAD: ACOS-CALC                                                 T: ( n -- c*127, find cos given survey column #[0-47])            DUP 12 <                                                        IF 1 SWAP 11 - NEGATE         ( quadrant I)                     ELSE DUP 24 <                                                     IF -1 SWAP 12 -             ( quadrant II)                      ELSE DUP 36 <                                                      IF -1 SWAP 35 - NEGATE   ( quadrant III)                        ELSE 1 SWAP 36 -         ( quadrant IV)                         THEN                                                         THEN                                                          THEN                                                            ASIN/COS + C@ SWAP -1 = IF NEGATE THEN T;                                                                                                                                                     ( ORBIT-OV - BSIN-CALC BCOS-CALC                      12-21-84)                                                                 HEAD: BSIN-CALC                                                   ( n -- s*127 , look up sin given survey row [0-23])           T: DUP 11 - ABS OVER 11 > IF 1- THEN ASIN/COS + C@                SWAP 11 > IF NEGATE THEN T;                                                                                                   HEAD: BCOS-CALC                                                 T: ( n -- c*127 , look up cos given survey row [0-23])            DUP 11 > IF 23 SWAP - ABS THEN                                           ASIN/COS + C@ T;                                                                                                     HEAD: !MAG ( xmag -- \ store x and an adjusted y mag)           T: DUP XMAG ! 176 100 */ YMAG ! T;                                                                                                                                                              ( ORBIT-OV - NEWVIEW PVERTRANS                       7-29-85)                                                                   HEAD: NEWVIEW                                                   T: ( -- \ build viewing transform, planet special case)           MROW @ DUP BSIN-CALC BSIN ! BCOS-CALC BCOS !                    MCOL @ DUP ASIN-CALC ASIN ! ACOS-CALC ACOS !                    DIST @ SCALE * H' ! ( distance) VTRANS 24 0 FILL                1VTRANS  2VTRANS  3VTRANS  5VTRANS  6VTRANS  7VTRANS            9VTRANS 10VTRANS 11VTRANS 12VTRANS T;                                                                                         HEAD: PVERTRANS                                                 T: ( -- \ transform all planet vertices & normals)                134 #IN ! ' xformvert 6 + @ 3DSEG !  0 Vout !                   ' vertex 6 + @  3DSEG @ - 16* Vin' !                            60 YSCREEN ! 36 XSCREEN !                                       ORTHAG.POINTS  62 #IN ! PERSPEC.SCREEN T;                     ( ORBIT-OV - ?VIS !PPOLY                          rfg03jun85)                                                                   HEAD: ?VIS ( n -- t \ determine visibility of facet n )         T:  DUP >R 0 SWAP FACET LC@ ( 1st-vertex -- n )                  4 SWAP XFORMVERT L@  ( z -- n\ depth of vertex)                 R> 62 + 4 SWAP XFORMVERT L@                                              ( z zN -- \ depth of normal) > T;                                                                                     CREATE !PPOLY ( Xul Yul Xur Yur Xlr Ylr Xll Yll -- \ save poly )            ( coordinates in G1POLY for clipping)                 HERE DUP 2- ! HEX B9 C, 04 C, 00 C, BB C, G1POLY , 83 C, C3 C,  0E C, 58 C, 5A C, 89 C, 17 C, 83 C, EB C, 02 C, 89 C, 07 C,     83 C, EB C, 02 C, E2 C, F2 C,  AD C, 8B C, D8 C, FF C, 27 C,  CREATE 8DROP HERE DUP 2- !                                        83 C, C4 C, 10 C, AD C, 8B C, D8 C, FF C, 27 C,               DECIMAL                                                         ( ORBIT-OV - DOPOLY      @XY                      rfg14jun85)   HEAD: DOPOLY                                                    T:       ( addr -- \ draw the polygon at addr within the ref)            (           quad previously defined by SETQUAD )         POLYSEG >R >R I' I LC@ !COLOR                                   I' I 1+  LC@ I' I  2+  LC@ QCOORD  ( Xul Yul)                   I' I 3 + LC@ I' I  2+  LC@ QCOORD                               I' I 3 + LC@ I' I  4 + LC@ QCOORD                               I' I 1+  LC@ R> R> SWAP 4 + LC@ QCOORD                          !PPOLY  G1POLY VIN !  G2POLY VOUT !  GOC OIN !  GOC2 OOUT !     0 ?OPEN !  4 #IN !  CLIPPER                                     #IN @ 2 > IF SCANPOLY LFILLPOLY THEN T;                                                                                       HEAD: @XY                                                       T:    ( n -- x y \get transformed x y coordinates for vertex n)   0 OVER XFORMVERT L@  2 ROT XFORMVERT L@ T;                    ( ORBIT-OV - SETREF DOPLANET                      rfg24jun85)   HEAD: SETREF ( n -- \ set reference quad to facet n)            T:  0 SWAP FACET >R >R                                            I I' LC@ @XY   I I' 1+ LC@ @XY   I I' 2+ LC@ @XY                R> R> 3 + LC@ @XY  SETQUAD T;                                 HEAD: DOPLANET                                                  T:         ( -- \ render a filled planet in view buffer)          VCLIPSET NEWVIEW PVERTRANS                                      72 0 DO  I ?VIS     ( is this facet visible?)                           IF I SETREF                                                        0 I FACE L@  2 I FACE LC@        ( addr ct --)                  0 DO DUP DOPOLY 5 +     ( do polygons)                            LOOP DROP  8DROP    ( drop reference quad)                 THEN                                                         LOOP circum T;                                                                                                           ( ORBIT-OV - ABS>MERC .STARS .STARFIELD               12-21-84) HEAD: ABS>MERC                                                  T:          ( Xabs Yabs -- Mcol Mrow \ mercator coord from abs)   40 / 23 SWAP - SWAP 48 / SWAP T;                                                                                              HEAD: .STARS    ( # -- \ plot some random stars)                T:  0 DO  0 71 RRND 0 119 RRND LPLOT LOOP T;                                                                                    HEAD: .STARFIELD                                                T: ( -- \ make distinctive star field behind planet)              GLOBALSEED @ SEED !                                             DK-GREEN !COLOR 1 4 RRND .STARS                                 WHITE    !COLOR 2 5 RRND .STARS                                 RED      !COLOR 2 5 RRND .STARS                                 GREY1    !COLOR 4 9 RRND .STARS T;                                                                                            ( ORBIT-OV - PLANET      **** TESTING ****   rfg21jun85)        : PLANET ( -- \ test rotating planet)                             MERCTEST                                                        make-globe   \ module                                           load-facet  load-vertex                                         >display >lores dark SHIP-CONSOLE                               mcol OFF                                                        GLOBALSEED @ SEED ! 40 90 RRND !MAG                                                  5 19 RRND MROW !                           XABS OFF YABS OFF                                             \   ' (.MERC) module ' .region+ module                            sinroll off scale cosroll ! >MAINVIEW                           BEGIN MCOL @ 1+ 48 MOD MCOL !                                         DARK .STARFIELD DOPLANET V>DISPLAY                          ?TERMINAL                                                     UNTIL >ALPHA PAGE ;                                           ( ORBIT-OV - >VIEWSITE                                 1-08-85) V: GMROW V: GMCOL V: DMAG                                       HEAD: >VIEWSITE ( -- \ rotate and expand planet to show site)   T:  >MAINVIEW                                                     XABS @ YABS @ ABS>MERC 2DUP  GMROW ! GMCOL !  MROW @ -          ABS SWAP  MCOL @ - DUP 0< IF 48 + THEN ( drow dcol --)          MAX  2 /  5 MAX ( # of iterations)                              90 XMAG @ - SWAP / 1 MAX DMAG !                                 BEGIN                                                             GMROW @ MROW @ -   DUP ABS 2 MIN  SWAP 0< IF NEGATE THEN        MROW +!  GMCOL @ MCOL @ - abs 4 MIN                             MCOL @ + 48 MOD MCOL !  DMAG @ XMAG @ + 90 MIN !MAG             DARK  .STARFIELD DOPLANET V>DISPLAY XMAG @ 90 =                 GMROW @ MROW @ = AND GMCOL @ MCOL @ = AND                     UNTIL T;                                                                                                                      ( ORBIT-OV - SHOWSITE EXPANDGLOBE                 rfg21jun85)                                                                   HEAD: SHOWSITE                                                  T: ( -- \ display globe looking at the landing site)              XABS @ YABS @ ABS>MERC MROW ! MCOL ! >MAINVIEW                  DARK .STARFIELD DOPLANET V>DISPLAY T;                                                                                         HEAD: EXPANDGLOBE                                                ( -- \ expand globe to grid transition point)                  T:  VCLIPSET >VIEWSITE                                           100 !mag showsite                                               130 !MAG SHOWSITE                                               180 !MAG SHOWSITE                                               250 !mag showsite                                               300 !MAG SHOWSITE T;                                                                                                           ( ORBIT-OV - AxB - Vector cross multiply          rfg03jun85)   EXIT ( THIS IS USED FOR SHADING )                               CODE AxB ( vx1 vy1 vz1 vx2 vy2 vz2 vx3 vy3 vz3 -- i j k, given    3 vertices of a polygon in space in clockwize order, compute    the normal vector i,j,k--- vectors must < 128 length)           vz3 POP  vy3 POP  vx3 POP  vz2 POP  vy2 POP  vx2 POP  vz1 POP   vy1 POP  vx1 POP  vx2 0 MOV  vy2 1 MOV  vz2 2 MOV               0 vx1 SUB  1 vy1 SUB  2 vz1 SUB  ( A )                          0 vx3 SUB  1 vy3 SUB  2 vz3 SUB  ( B )                          vy1 0 MOV  vz3 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U MOV                         vy3 0 MOV  vz1 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U SUB  U PUSH  ( i)           vz1 0 MOV  vx3 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U MOV                         vz3 0 MOV  vx1 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U SUB  U PUSH  ( j)           vx1 0 MOV  vy3 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U MOV                         vx3 0 MOV  vy1 1 MOV  1 IMUL B  0 U SUB  U PUSH  ( k) NEXT                                                                    ( ORBIT-OV - VNORM A.B A+B                            12-21-84) EXIT ( THIS IS USED FOR SHADING)                                : VNORM ( i j k -- i' j' k', normalize vector scaled up by 100 )  vz1 ! vy1 ! DUP vx1 ! DUP M*  vy1 @ DUP M*  vz1 @ DUP M*        D+ D+ SQRT >R ( magnitude)  vx1 @ 100 I */  vy1 @ 100 I */      vz1 @ 100 R> */ ;                                                                                                             CODE A.B ( i1 j1 k1 i2 j2 k2 -- n, dot product, ijk<101)          0 POP 1 POP U POP 2 POP 2 IMUL B  0 1 XCHG  2 POP  2 IMUL B     0 1 ADD  U 0 MOV  2 POP 2 IMUL B  0 1 ADD 1 PUSH NEXT                                                                         CODE A+B ( i1 j1 k1 i2 j2 k2 -- i' j' k', vector addition)        0 POP 1 POP 2 POP U POP U 0 ADD U POP U 1 ADD U POP             U 2 ADD  2 PUSH 1 PUSH 0 PUSH NEXT                                                                                                                                                            ( ORBIT-OV - AVGREGION MAKE9X9COARSE                  11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: AVGREGION                                                 T:          ( -- n \ get the average value for the corners of                        the current region)                          XLL @ YLL @ ACELLADDR A@   XUR @ YLL @ ACELLADDR A@             XUR @ YUR @ ACELLADDR A@   XLL @ YLL @ ACELLADDR A@             + + + 2/ 2/ T;                                                HEAD: MAKE9X9COARSE                                             T:              ( -- \ build initial approach altitude array                           from contour)                             SIGNEXTEND ON SPHEREWRAP OFF ' CONTOUR SETLARRAY                9 0 DO 9 0 DO                                                   I 8 * 1+  XVIS @ XCON @ - +     J 6 * 1+ YVIS @ YCON @ - +      OVER 8 + OVER 6 + SETREGION  AVGREGION                          I J 9X9COARSE LC! LOOP LOOP T;                                 ( ORBIT-OV - MAKE9X9FINE                              12-22-84)                                                                 HEAD: MAKE9X9FINE                                               T:            ( -- \ build final approach altitude array from                        contour)                                     XABS @ 3 - XCON @ - X1 !                                        YABS @ 3 + YCON @ - Y1 !                                        9 0 DO 9 0 DO I X1 @ +                                                        Y1 @ J - CONTOUR LC@                                            I J 9X9FINE LC!  LOOP LOOP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ( ORBIT-OV - @XYZ>G2POLY                              11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: @XYZ>G2POLY ( n -- get polygon n x,y,z untransformed                                                       vertices)      T:  3 0 DO I OVER GPOLY LC@                                         3 0 DO I OVER GVERTEX LC@                                            J 3 * I + G2POLY + C!                                          LOOP DROP                                                       LOOP DROP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ( ORBIT-OV - @POLY                                    11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: @POLY ( n --, get 3 x,y vertices & save in polygon clip                      workspace array as y,x)                      T:  3 0 DO I OVER GPOLY LC@                                       2 0 DO I 2* OVER XFORMVERT L@                                          J 4 * G1POLY + I 1- NEGATE 2* + ! LOOP DROP                  LOOP DROP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ( ORBIT-OV - GVERTRANS                            rfg21jun85)   \ : GVERTRANS ( -- , transform all grid vertices)               \  117 #IN !                                                    \  ' GVERTEX   6 + @ 3DSEG !      0 VIN !                       \  ' G1VERT    6 + @ 3DSEG @ - 16* VIN' !                       \  ' XFORMVERT 6 + @ 3DSEG @ - 16* VOUT !                       \  60 YSCREEN !  36 XSCREEN !                                   \  VIEW>ORIGIN  ORTHAG.POINTS  PERSPEC.SCREEN ;                 HEAD: gvertrans                                                 T: 117 #in !                                                     ' xformvert 6 + @ 3dseg ! 0 vout !                              ' G1VERT    6 + @ 3DSEG @ - 16* VIN' !                          ' gvertex   6 + @ 3dseg @ - 16* vin !                            60 YSCREEN !  36 XSCREEN !                                      VIEW>ORIGIN  ORTHAG.POINTS  PERSPEC.SCREEN T;                                                                                 ( ORBIT-OV - VSS ?#VIS                                11-30-84) V: VSS                                                          HEAD: ?#VIS ( n -- # , # of vertices in front of the viewing                           plane for polygon n )                    T:  0 VSS !                                                       3 0 DO I OVER GPOLY LC@                                                4 SWAP XFORMVERT L@                                             SCALE - 0> IF 1 VSS +! THEN                                  LOOP DROP VSS @ T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ( ORBIT-OV - G2ORTHAG                                 11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: G2ORTHAG                                                  T:         ( compute orthagonal coordinates for polygon in g2)    3 #IN ! G2POLY VIN !  G1POLY VIN' !  G3POLY VOUT !              @DS 3DSEG ! VIEW>ORIGIN  ORTHAG.POINTS T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ( ORBIT-OV - ZCLIPSET ZXGET ZYGET XSAVE               11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: ZCLIPSET ( set clipping window for z,x & z,y clipping)    T:  16000 16000 SCALE -16000 SETCLIPWINDOW T;                                                                                   HEAD: ZXGET ( get z,x vertices for clipping)                    T:  3 0 DO I 6 * G3POLY + DUP @ SWAP 4 + @  ( X,Z --)                    I 2* 2* G1POLY + >R I ! R> 2+ ! LOOP T;                                                                                HEAD: ZYGET ( get z,y vertices for clipping)                    T:  3 0 DO I 6 * G3POLY + DUP 2 + @ SWAP 4 + @  ( Y,Z --)                I 2* 2* G1POLY + >R I ! R> 2+ ! LOOP T;                                                                                HEAD: XSAVE ( save x after z,x clipping)                        T: #IN @ 0 DO VIN @ I 2* 2* + 2 + @ G3POLY I 6 * + ! LOOP T;                                                                    ( ORBIT-OV - YSAVE ZSAVE XY>G1POLY                    11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: YSAVE ( save y after z,y clipping)                        T: #IN @ 0                                                        DO VIN @ I 2* 2* + 2 + @ G3POLY I 6 * + 2+ ! LOOP T;                                                                          HEAD: ZSAVE ( save z after z,y clipping)                        T: #IN @ 0                                                        DO VIN @ I 2* 2* + @ G3POLY I 6 * + 4 + ! LOOP T;                                                                             HEAD: XY>G1POLY                                                 T: #IN @ 0                                                        DO I 6 * G3POLY + DUP @ SWAP 2+ @ ( X,Y--)                      I 2* 2* G1POLY + >R I ! R> 2+ ! LOOP T;                                                                                                                                                       ( ORBIT-OV - @CLIPOLY SETPOLYCOLOR                    11-30-84)                                                                 HEAD: @CLIPOLY ( n --, 3D clip polygon n)                       T:  @XYZ>G2POLY G2ORTHAG ZCLIPSET ZXGET 3 #IN !                   G1POLY VIN ! G2POLY VOUT ! GOC OIN ! GOC2 OOUT !                CLIPPER XSAVE ZYGET 3 #IN ! G1POLY VIN ! G2POLY VOUT !          CLIPPER YSAVE ZSAVE VCLIPSET G3POLY VOUT ! PERSPEC.SCREEN       XY>G1POLY T;                                                                                                                                                                                  HEAD: SETPOLYCOLOR ( n -- \ set color & dither for polygon n)   T: 2/ 0 SWAP GRIDCOLOR OVER OVER LC@ COLOR ! 1+ LC@ DCOLOR ! T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \ hibeep,lobeep for debugging                     rfg21jun85)                                                                   HEAD: hibeep                                                    T:   500 beeptone ! beep T;                                                                                                     HEAD: lobeep                                                    T:  3000 beeptone ! beep T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ( ORBIT-OV - DOGRID                               rfg21jun85)   HEAD: DOGRID ( -- , render & display grid)                      T:  SKY-COLOR @ !COLOR BFILL                                      CALC[VTRANS] GVERTRANS 178 0  ( for all polygons)               DO I ?#VIS DUP  (  vertices in front)                              IF 3 =                     ( any in front?)                        IF  I @POLY  3 #IN !     ( if all, get them)                    ELSE I @CLIPOLY         ( else, 3D clip )                       THEN                                                            G1POLY VIN ! G2POLY VOUT ! ( do viewing window clip)            GOC OIN ! GOC2 OOUT ! 0 ?OPEN ! #IN @ 2 > IF                    CLIPPER THEN #IN @ 2 >  ( if any part visible...)               IF I SETPOLYCOLOR SCANPOLY LFILLPOLY THEN                    ELSE DROP                                                       THEN                                                         LOOP V>DISPLAY T;                                             ( ORBIT-OV - FLATGRID LIMITGRID                        8-01-85)                                                                 HEAD: FLATGRID ( -- \ set y value for landing grid to 0)        T:  117 0 DO 0 1 I GVERTEX LC! LOOP T;                                                                                          HEAD: LIMITGRID ( -- \ set y value for landing grid to legal)     ( range)                                                      T:  117 0 DO 1 I GVERTEX LC@                                                 2/ 2/ 2/ 30 MIN 1 I GVERTEX LC!                              LOOP                                                      1 21 GVERTEX LC@ 1 20 GVERTEX LC@ + 2/ DUP DUP ( average)       1 21 GVERTEX LC! 1 20 GVERTEX LC!                               117 108 DO DUP 1 I GVERTEX LC! LOOP DROP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                 ( ORBIT-OV - GVERTEX>GRIDCOLOR                    rfg21jun85)                                                                   HEAD: GVERTEX>GRIDCOLOR ( -- set grid polygon colors based on                            altitude )                             T:  SET-COLORMAP                                                  5 0 DO                                                          5 0 DO 1 J 6 * I + GVERTEX  L+-@  COLORMAP                             color @ DUP 256 * +                                             0 J 5 * I + GRIDCOLOR L! LOOP LOOP                       8 0 DO                                                          8 0 DO 1 J 9 * I + 36 + GVERTEX L+-@ COLORMAP                          color @ DUP 256 * +                                             0 J 8 * I + 25 + GRIDCOLOR L! LOOP LOOP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( ORBIT-OV -  FILLCTRGRIG MERC>GVERTEX            rfg21jun85)                                                                   HEAD: FILLCTRGRID ( -- \ make center of 5x5 same as altitude of                      ul corner of center)                       T: 1 14 GVERTEX LC@ 117 36 DO DUP  1 I GVERTEX  LC! LOOP DROP T;                                                                HEAD: MERC>GVERTEX ( -- \ set altitudes in GVERTEX based on site                      selected on mercator map)                 T:  XABS @ YABS @ ABS>MERC  23 SWAP - 2+ Y1 !  2 - X1 !           SPHEREWRAP ON  SIGNEXTEND ON  ' MERCATOR SETLARRAY              6 0 DO 6 0 DO I X1 @ + Y1 @ J -                                               ACELLADDR A@  1 J 6 * I + GVERTEX LC!             LOOP LOOP  FILLCTRGRID  T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ( ORBIT-OV - 9X9COARSE>GVERTEX ...                    12-22-84)                                                                 HEAD: 9X9COARSE>GVERTEX                                           ( -- \ move 9x9coarse to cntr of gvertex)                     T:  9 0 DO                                                        9 0 DO I J 9X9COARSE LC@                                               1 J 9 * I + 36 + GVERTEX LC! LOOP LOOP T;                                                                              HEAD: 9X9FINE>GVERTEX ( -- \ move 9x9fine to cntr of gvertex)   T:  9 0 DO                                                        9 0 DO I J 9X9FINE LC@                                                 1 J 9 * I + 36 + GVERTEX LC! LOOP LOOP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ( ORBIT-OV - COARSEGRID                               12-22-84) HEAD: COARSEGRID                                                T:           ( -- \expand coarse grid to fine transition point)   MERC>GVERTEX                                                    GVERTEX>GRIDCOLOR                                               FLATGRID                                                        0 SINROLL !                                                     SCALE COSROLL 