                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                ( FRACT-OV   XSHIFT                                    8-05-85) ASSEMBLER                                                       CREATE XSHIFT ( y rtn -- \ displace midpt of x1,y x2,y)           1 POP TY POP 1 PUSH                                             FX1 R) PUSH TY PUSH [ACELLADDR] CALL [A@] CALL                  FX2 R) PUSH TY PUSH [ACELLADDR] CALL [A@] CALL                  0 POP 1 POP 1 0 ADD 0 SAR 0 PUSH  ( h -- \ average height)      FX1 R) U MOV FX2 R) U ADD U SAR   ( h -- \ calc mid x coord)    U PUSH TY PUSH                    ( h x' y--)                   DISPLACEMNT CALL                  ( h h' -- \ new height)       C+LIMIT CALL                      ( prevent byte wrap)          FXMID R) PUSH TY PUSH [!HEIGHT] CALL RET                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ( FRACT-OV   YSHIFT                                    8-05-85) ASSEMBLER                                                       CREATE YSHIFT ( x rtn -- \ displace midpt of x,y1 x,y2)           1 POP TY POP 1 PUSH                                             TY PUSH FY1 R) PUSH [ACELLADDR] CALL [A@] CALL                  TY PUSH FY2 R) PUSH [ACELLADDR] CALL [A@] CALL                  0 POP 1 POP 1 0 ADD 0 SAR 0 PUSH  ( h -- \ average height)      TY PUSH                                                         FY1 R) U MOV FY2 R) U ADD U SAR   ( h -- \ calc mid x coord)    U PUSH DISPLACEMNT CALL           ( h h' -- \ new height)       C+LIMIT CALL                  