1 0 ADD              0 SAR 0 SAR  0 PUSH ( average edge midpt heights)               FXMID R) PUSH FYMID R) PUSH DISPLACEMNT CALL                    C+LIMIT CALL                                                    FXMID R) PUSH FYMID R) PUSH [!HEIGHT] CALL                   THEN RET                                                                                                                      ( FRACT-OV   MIDPT NEWSTD                              8-07-85) ASSEMBLER                                                       CREATE MIDPT ( compute midpoint)                                  FX1 R) 0 MOV  FX2 R) 0 ADD  0 SAR  0 FXMID R) MOV               FY1 R) 0 MOV  FY2 R) 0 ADD  0 SAR  0 FYMID R) MOV RET                                                                         CREATE NEWSTD ( rtn -- \ compute new standard deviation)          FSTD R) 0 MOV  RATIO 2+ MUL  RATIO DIV                          0 0 OR 0> NOT IF 1 # 0 MOV THEN  0 FSTD R) MOV RET                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ( FRACT-OV   [FRACTAL]                                 8-05-85) ASSEMBLER CREATE [FRACTAL] ( std xmid ymid x1 y1 x2 y2 rtn -- )   S R MOV  FX2 R) 0 MOV  FX1 R) 0 SUB  0 DEC 0>                   IF 1 # 0 MOV ELSE 0 0 XOR THEN 0 DX>1 MOV                                FY2 R) 1 MOV  FY1 R) 1 SUB  1 DEC 0>                   IF 1 # 1 MOV ELSE 1 1 XOR THEN 1 DY>1 MOV 1 0 OR 0>             IF MIDPT CALL EDGES CALL CENTER CALL NEWSTD CALL                   0 0 XOR  FSTD R) PUSH  0 PUSH 0 PUSH  FX1 R) PUSH               FY1 R) PUSH  FXMID R) PUSH  FYMID R) PUSH [FRACTAL] CALL        0 0 XOR  FSTD R) PUSH  0 PUSH 0 PUSH  FXMID R) PUSH             FY1 R) PUSH  FX2 R) PUSH  FYMID R) PUSH [FRACTAL] CALL          0 0 XOR  FSTD R) PUSH  0 PUSH 0 PUSH  FX1 R) PUSH               FYMID R) PUSH  FXMID R) PUSH  FY2 R) PUSH [FRACTAL] CALL        0 0 XOR  FSTD R) PUSH  0 PUSH 0 PUSH  FXMID R) PUSH             FYMID R) PUSH  FX2 R) PUSH  FY2 R) PUSH [FRACTAL] CALL       THEN  0 POP 14 # S ADD S R MOV 0 PUSH RET                     ( FRACT-OV   FRACTALIZE  FILLARRAY                     8-05-85)                                                                 CODE FRACTALIZE ( std 0 0 x1 y1 x2 y2 --)                         R RTEMP MOV  [FRACTAL] CALL  RTEMP R MOV NEXT                                                                                                                                                 CODE FILLARRAY ( val -- \ fill current array with val)            0 POP  'ARRAY U MOV  4 3) 1 MOV  6 3) U MOV  ES PUSHS           W PUSH  U ES LSG  W W XOR REP STOS B  W POP  ES POPS  NEXT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    ( FRACT-OV   FRACT-REGION                             11-19-84)                                                                 : FRACT-REGION ( -- \ do a fractal for)                           ( current region)                                               STD @  0 0  XLL @  YLL @                                        XUR @ YUR @  FRACTALIZE ;                                                                                                                                                                                     