HEX                                                             CODE ABSTRACT ( source dest bit-count -- \ make a bit-wise )      ( abstraction of the source bit string at dest)                 1 POP          \  count                                         0 POP  2 POP   \  temp                                          W PUSH I PUSH  \  preserve regs                                 2 I MOV        \  source addr pointer                           0 W MOV        \  dest addr pointer                             I ) 0 MOV      \  get 1st word                                  10 # U MOV     \  set bit counter to dec16                      BEGIN                                                             0 RCL  2 RCL   \  move bit to reg 2                             8000 # 0 TEST  \  test hi bit of reg 0                          0= NOT IF 1 # 2 XOR   \  toggle lo bit of reg 2                        THEN                                                 ( BITOP - ABSTRACT                                     8-28-85) HEX ASSEMBLER                                                       U DEC                \ decrement bit counter                    0= IF 0 RCL 2 RCL    \ move bit to reg 2                              2 # I ADD      \ point to next source word                      I ) 0 MOV      \ get next source word                           8000 # 0 TEST  \ compare hi bit to reg 2 lo bit                 0= NOT                                                          IF 1 # 2 XOR   \ toggle lo bit if hi bit on                     THEN           \                                                2 W ) MOV      \ output dest word                               2 # W ADD      \ point to next output word                      10 # U MOV     \ init bit pointer                            THEN                                                        LOOP                                                                                                                         ( BITOP - ABSTRACT                                     8-28-85) HEX ASSEMBLER                                                      U U OR 0= NOT      \ bits left?                                 IF U 1 MOV         \ align bits in last word                       2 SHL V         \ left justify                                  2 W ) MOV       \ move out fractional word                   THEN                                                            I POP  W POP       \ restore regs                               NEXT                                                                                                                         DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( BITOP - ABSTRACT test                                8-28-85) CREATE BITSS 40 ALLOT BITSS 40 0 FILL                           " THIS IS A TEST" BITSS SWAP CMOVE                              V= XXX                                                          HEX                                                             : B. ( n bitcnt -- \ display cnt left bits in number n)           0 DO 8000 OVER AND NOT NOT . -1 COL +! 2* LOOP ;              DECIMAL                                                         : TABS ( display test abstractions)                               >LORES >DISPLAY @DS BLTSEG ! DARK WHITE !COLOR XORMODE OFF      BEGIN  \ 20 0 DO  FRND                                                  \ I 2* BITSS + ! LOOP                                                              BITSS ABLT !                         2 150 DO 1 LBLT ! ( 150 I -) 0 XBLT !                           BITSS BITSS I ABSTRACT  I 1- WBLT ! 160 I - YBLT !              BITSS ABLT ! {BLT} -1 +LOOP ke